---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
    title="Freelance Front End Web Developer in London | Simon Morgan"
    description="Freelance/contract front end developer with 18+ years' experience. Fast, accessible websites using Astro, WordPress, Sanity CMS & design systems.">
    <section id="introduction" class="section">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="grid grid--compact">
                <div class="grid-item grid-item--10">
                    <h1 class="mb-1">Freelance Front End Web Developer, based in London</h1>
                </div>
                <div class="grid-item grid-item--8">
                    <p class="text-lg">
                        Over 18 years of professional experience building for the web, working directly with <a href="/website-development-small-business"
                            >clients</a
                        > and alongside <a href="/front-end-developer-for-agencies">agencies</a> of all sizes.
                    </p>
                    <p class="">
                        I specialise in creating accessible, responsive and performant websites — from static sites and design systems to full CMS builds and
                        web apps. Whether you need a hands-on contractor to slot into an existing team, or someone to take a project from scratch through to
                        launch, I bring deep front end expertise across modern frameworks (Astro, 11ty), CMS platforms (WordPress, Sanity) and design systems
                        (Storybook, Fractal).
                    </p>
                    <p>
                        I work remotely, hybrid or on-site, and I'm equally comfortable owning a build end-to-end or fitting into an established agency workflow
                        on a day-rate or project basis.
                    </p>
                    <p class="group">
                        <a href="/contact" class="button">Get in touch</a>
                        <a href="/about" class="button button--tertiary">About me</a>
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>
    <section id="services" class="section">
        <div class="container flow">
            <div class="grid">
                <div class="grid-item grid-item--8 flow">
                    <h2>Services</h2>
                    <p class="text-md">
                        I focus on creating websites using web standards and open source technologies to provide modern, accessible and easily maintainable
                        websites & applications. See below for an overview of my primary services:
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="grid">
                <div class="grid-item grid-item--4">
                    <div class="feature flow">
                        <!-- https://heroicons.com/outline -->
                        <h3 class="feature__heading">
                            <svg
                                xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
                                fill="none"
                                viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                                stroke-width="1"
                                stroke="currentColor"
                                class="icon icon--xl color-blue"
                                aria-hidden="true">
                                <path
                                    stroke-linecap="round"
                                    stroke-linejoin="round"
                                    d="M9 17.25v1.007a3 3 0 0 1-.879 2.122L7.5 21h9l-.621-.621A3 3 0 0 1 15 18.257V17.25m6-12V15a2.25 2.25 0 0 1-2.25 2.25H5.25A2.25 2.25 0 0 1 3 15V5.25m18 0A2.25 2.25 0 0 0 18.75 3H5.25A2.25 2.25 0 0 0 3 5.25m18 0V12a2.25 2.25 0 0 1-2.25 2.25H5.25A2.25 2.25 0 0 1 3 12V5.25"
                                ></path>
                            </svg>

                            Website <br />Development
                        </h3>
                        <p>
                            I can deliver templates, prototypes, component libraries, static (SSG) and CMS websites using tech such as (but not limited
                            to&hellip;):
                        </p>
                        <ul>
                            <li>HTML / CSS</li>
                            <li>Javascript / Typescript</li>
                            <li>Wordpress / PHP / Sanity (Headless Platform)</li>
                            <li>Astro / 11ty / React / Next.js /</li>
                            <li>Web components</li>
                        </ul>
                        <p>
                            Ideal for <a href="/front-end-developer-for-agencies">agencies</a> needing extra front end capacity, or <a
                                href="/website-development-small-business">businesses</a
                            > wanting a single point of contact for their build.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="grid-item grid-item--4">
                    <div class="feature flow">
                        <h3 class="feature__heading">
                            <svg
                                xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
                                fill="none"
                                viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                                stroke-width="1"
                                stroke="currentColor"
                                class="icon icon--xl color-blue"
                                aria-hidden="true">
                                <path
                                    stroke-linecap="round"
                                    stroke-linejoin="round"
                                    d="M9.53 16.122a3 3 0 0 0-5.78 1.128 2.25 2.25 0 0 1-2.4 2.245 4.5 4.5 0 0 0 8.4-2.245c0-.399-.078-.78-.22-1.128Zm0 0a15.998 15.998 0 0 0 3.388-1.62m-5.043-.025a15.994 15.994 0 0 1 1.622-3.395m3.42 3.42a15.995 15.995 0 0 0 4.764-4.648l3.876-5.814a1.151 1.151 0 0 0-1.597-1.597L14.146 6.32a15.996 15.996 0 0 0-4.649 4.763m3.42 3.42a6.776 6.776 0 0 0-3.42-3.42"
                                ></path>
                            </svg>
                            Design <br />Systems
                        </h3>
                        <p>I've delivered numerous design systems & component libraries for clients using tools such as:</p>
                        <ul>
                            <li>Storybook</li>
                            <li>Fractal</li>
                            <li>11ty + Nunjucks/Liquid/Handlebars</li>
                        </ul>
                        <p>
                            I work with design and dev teams to turn Figma/Sketch designs into robust, documented, reusable component libraries that scale
                            across products and teams.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="grid-item grid-item--4">
                    <div class="feature flow">
                        <h3 class="feature__heading">
                            <svg
                                xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
                                fill="none"
                                viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                                stroke-width="1"
                                stroke="currentColor"
                                class="icon icon--xl color-blue"
                                aria-hidden="true">
                                <path
                                    stroke-linecap="round"
                                    stroke-linejoin="round"
                                    d="M12 21a9.004 9.004 0 0 0 8.716-6.747M12 21a9.004 9.004 0 0 1-8.716-6.747M12 21c2.485 0 4.5-4.03 4.5-9S14.485 3 12 3m0 18c-2.485 0-4.5-4.03-4.5-9S9.515 3 12 3m0 0a8.997 8.997 0 0 1 7.843 4.582M12 3a8.997 8.997 0 0 0-7.843 4.582m15.686 0A11.953 11.953 0 0 1 12 10.5c-2.998 0-5.74-1.1-7.843-2.918m15.686 0A8.959 8.959 0 0 1 21 12c0 .778-.099 1.533-.284 2.253m0 0A17.919 17.919 0 0 1 12 16.5c-3.162 0-6.133-.815-8.716-2.247m0 0A9.015 9.015 0 0 1 3 12c0-1.605.42-3.113 1.157-4.418"
                                ></path>
                            </svg>
                            SEO & Accessibility <br />Audits
                        </h3>
                        <p>I can provide consultancy and advice on technical SEO, Accessibility and Analytics for your websites.</p>
                        <ul>
                            <li>Audits</li>
                            <li>Bug fixing</li>
                            <li>Best practice</li>
                        </ul>
                        <p>
                            Whether you need a one-off audit ahead of a launch, or ongoing support to stay compliant with WCAG standards, I can help identify
                            issues and implement fixes.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>
    <section id="get-in-touch" class="section section--padded bg-blue-dark color-white mb-0">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="grid">
                <div class="grid-item grid-item--8 flow">
                    <h2 class="h1">Get in touch</h2>
                    <p class="text-lg">Need help with your website or an extra pair of hands on your next project?</p>
                    <p>
                        <a href="/contact" class="button button--secondary">Get in touch</a>
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>
</Layout>
